[[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">Op. 7055B42 LH OR RH REFLECTOR(ONE) ON REAR BUMPERS - R R</a></p><p>1. Undo the nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the hinge.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035631.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the hinge is undamaged.</p><p>Fit the hinge and screw in the nuts without\ntightening them.</p><p>When the bonnet is fitted, refer to op.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892130\">Op. 7025A10 BONNET LID - SQUARE</a></p>"],[3,16,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the hinges.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/186000109.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,16,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the hinges are not damaged.</p><p>Position the hinges and screw in the bolts without tightening them.</p><p>With the bonnet fitted, refer to op.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892130\">Op. 7025A10 BONNET LID - SQUARE</a></p>"]]